{"seq":24,"slug":"browser-rendering-internals","title":"浏览器渲染引擎原理","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 浏览器渲染引擎原理\n\n打开一个网页，从地址栏回车到屏幕上出现第一帧像素，浏览器在几百毫秒内完成了一整套精密的流水线工作：拉取字节、解析成树、计算样式与几何、绘制成图层、再交给 GPU 合成。这套机制大多数时候对开发者是透明的——直到页面卡顿、动画掉帧、滚动发涩，你才需要掀开盖子，看清里面到底发生了什么。\n\n这个 hub 的目标，是把现代浏览器（以 Chromium 的 RenderingNG 架构为主要参照，兼顾 Firefox 的 WebRender 与 Safari 的 WebKit）的渲染机制讲透，让你不再把渲染当成黑盒，而是能预测一次 DOM 改动会触发哪些阶段、会付出多少代价、该如何把工作挪到不阻塞用户的地方去。\n\n四章的安排是层层递进的。第一章「基础」搭地基：浏览器为什么是多进程、主线程与合成线程如何分工、字节如何被解析成 DOM 与 CSSOM、两棵树又如何合成渲染树。没有这层认知，后面的优化都是背口诀。第二章「渲染流水线」是全 hub 的核心，把渲染树之后的三个阶段——布局（算几何）、绘制（生成绘制指令）、合成（切图层、栅格化、交给 GPU）——一个个拆开讲清楚，这也是 RenderingNG 重构最深的地方。\n\n第三章「性能」把前两章的机制转成可操作的优化判断：关键渲染路径如何决定首屏速度、回流与重绘各自代价几何、什么情况下该把元素提升到独立图层交给 GPU、又在什么情况下提升反而拖垮性能。第四章「运行时」收口到真实的运行环境：事件循环如何决定每一帧的渲染时机、JS 引擎与渲染引擎在主线程上如何争抢、以及当页面真的卡了，怎样用 DevTools 一步步定位到罪魁祸首。\n\n四章之间不是孤立的。基础章定义的概念（进程、主线程、两棵树）会在流水线章被反复引用；流水线章建立的阶段模型，是性能章谈代价、运行时章谈时机的共同语言。建议按顺序读，但每篇也都通过交叉链接指向相关篇目，方便你随时跳转回查。读完之后，当你看到一次 `element.offsetHeight` 读取、一行 `will-change: transform`、或一个掉帧的滚动，你脑中应该能立刻浮现出它在这条流水线上对应的位置与代价。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"browser-architecture","title":"浏览器多进程架构","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/foundations/browser-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"parsing-dom-cssom","title":"解析：DOM 与 CSSOM","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/foundations/parsing-dom-cssom"},{"seq":3,"slug":"render-tree","title":"渲染树构建","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/foundations/render-tree"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline","title":"渲染流水线","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"layout-reflow","title":"布局与回流","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/layout-reflow"},{"seq":2,"slug":"paint","title":"绘制","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/paint"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compositing","title":"合成与图层","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/compositing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance","title":"性能","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"critical-rendering-path","title":"关键渲染路径","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/performance/critical-rendering-path"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reflow-repaint-cost","title":"回流与重绘代价","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/performance/reflow-repaint-cost"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gpu-acceleration","title":"GPU 加速","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/performance/gpu-acceleration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"runtime","title":"运行时","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/runtime","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-loop-rendering","title":"事件循环与渲染时机","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/runtime/event-loop-rendering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"js-engine-interaction","title":"JS 引擎与渲染交互","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/runtime/js-engine-interaction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rendering-debugging","title":"渲染性能排查","url":"/h/frontend/browser-rendering-internals/runtime/rendering-debugging"}]}]}